.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Xiangling","r":[0.1704,0.7059,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Xingqiu","r":[0.2148,0.7059,0.037,0.0296]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/jean/261111-225016/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Favonius Sword","text":"ER and team particles on CRIT. Helps Jean and allies Burst consistently; build CRIT Rate."},{"name":"Freedom-Sworn","text":"EM and a team buff after reactions. Especially effective when Jean reliably Swirls in Sunfire."},{"name":"Skyward Blade","text":"High Base ATK and ER support Jean’s healing, damage, and Burst uptime. A comfortable five-star alternative."},{"name":"Primordial Jade Cutter","text":"High CRIT Rate improves Jean’s personal damage and Favonius-style stat balance, but provides no team Energy utility."},{"name":"Xiphos' Moonlight","text":"Great for EM-focused Sunfire Jean. Converts EM into ER and shares a smaller Energy Recharge bonus with teammates. Best with an EM Sunfire build."},{"name":"Amenoma Kageuchi","text":"Craftable ATK sword that improves healing and refunds Energy after Burst. Refinements make it more comfortable."},{"name":"Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","text":"Free fishing sword with substantial ER and bonus Skill CRIT Rate. Reliable when Favonius is unavailable."},{"name":"Sapwood Blade","text":"Craftable ER sword with high Base ATK. Useful for healing and Burst uptime, though its passive is situational."}],"a":[{"names":["Viridescent Venerer"],"text":"Best general support set. Swirl reduces the affected element’s enemy resistance, improving team damage.","stats":"ER or ATK% / ATK% / Healing Bonus"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Provides a teamwide ATK buff after Burst if no teammate already uses Noblesse and VV shred is less valuable.","stats":"ER or ATK% / ATK% / Healing Bonus"},{"names":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"text":"Converts Jean’s large team heal into extra damage when Viridescent and Noblesse bonuses are already covered.","stats":"ER or ATK% / ATK% / Healing Bonus"}],"t":[{"name":"Tidal Windfall","members":["Jean","Neuvillette","Furina","Xilonen"],"text":"Jean heals the whole party for Furina’s Fanfare and shreds Hydro RES. Neuvillette leads the damage while Xilonen adds buffs.","roles":["Healer / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Afterlife Breeze","members":["Jean","Hu Tao","Furina","Yelan"],"text":"Jean heals Furina’s HP drain and shreds Hydro RES. Furina and Yelan enable Hu Tao’s powerful Vaporize attacks.","roles":["Healer / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Buffer"]},{"name":"Stormfront Sonata","members":["Jean","Raiden Shogun","Furina","Yelan"],"text":"Raiden drives Electro damage and batteries the team. Furina and Yelan add Hydro damage while Jean heals and Swirls.","roles":["Healer / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Buffer"]},{"name":"Budget Sunfire","members":["Jean","Bennett","Xiangling","Xingqiu"],"text":"Jean and Bennett create Sunfire Pyro Swirls. Xiangling adds damage, while Xingqiu provides Hydro for Vaporize.","roles":["Healer / Debuffer","Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Pyro Enabler","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler"]}],"v":"Furina Support: Prioritize enough ER to Burst every rotation. Use 4-piece Viridescent and stack ATK or Healing Bonus for fast Fanfare.\nSunfire Jean: Use Jean and Bennett Bursts together. Level Jean to 90 and prioritize EM and ER for repeated Pyro Swirls.\nFavonius Healer: Build CRIT Rate so Favonius triggers reliably. ER and ATK help keep team healing and Bursts consistent.\nDamage Jean: Use an Anemo goblet and CRIT circlet if team healing is already sufficient. This trades sustain for personal damage.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Healer / Support"],"about":"Jean is a flexible Anemo healer who restores the whole party with her Burst and weakens enemy resistance using Viridescent Venerer. She pairs especially well with Furina by quickly building Fanfare. Her Bennett Sunfire combo adds rapid Pyro application for reaction teams.","pros":["Strong teamwide healing","Viridescent RES shred","Flexible support options","Useful enemy control"],"cons":["High ER Needs","Limited damage buffs","Weak Grouping","Sunfire locks positioning","C4 only buffs Anemo"],"weapons":["Favonius Sword","Freedom-Sworn","Skyward Blade","Primordial Jade Cutter","Xiphos' Moonlight","Amenoma Kageuchi","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","Sapwood Blade"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["ER / ATK%","ATK%","Healing Bonus / CRIT Rate"],"stats":["ER: 160% - 200% (Solo Anemo)","ER: 140% - 160% (Double Anemo)","ATK: 1,800+ for healing","CRIT Rate: 40%+ with Favonius","EM: 700+ for dedicated Sunfire"],"vars":[{"title":"Viridescent Healer","role":"Healer","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Freedom-Sworn"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER / ATK% / Healing or CRIT for Favonius.","teams":"Swirlable damage dealers and party healing demand.","when":"Provide healing and elemental RES shred with low field time.","cond":"","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Sunfire Jean","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Skyward Blade"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Add EM when focusing on self-Swirled Pyro reactions.","teams":"Bennett Burst and close positioning.","when":"Jean and Bennett Bursts repeatedly Swirl Pyro for reactions.","cond":"","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Vayuda Turquoise Sliver","Vayuda Turquoise Fragment","Vayuda Turquoise Chunk","Vayuda Turquoise Gemstone","Hurricane Seed","Teachings of Resistance","Guide to Resistance","Philosophies of Resistance","Damaged Mask","Stained Mask","Ominous Mask","Dandelion Seed","Dvalin's Plume","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 6–8"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Tidal Windfall","members":["Jean","Neuvillette","Furina","Xilonen"]},{"name":"Afterlife Breeze","members":["Jean","Hu Tao","Furina","Yelan"]},{"name":"Stormfront Sonata","members":["Jean","Raiden Shogun","Furina","Yelan"]},{"name":"Budget Sunfire","members":["Jean","Bennett","Xiangling","Xingqiu"]}]}}],"title":"Jean","el":"Anemo"}